# With no structure in x the field is a half cosine between the walls and the index follows from the exact slab index.
# Reference: analytic slab index 2.796123, lowered by the lateral half cosine to 2.794445; agreement limited by the grid.
title 340 nm silicon film, TM, between distant walls
grid dx=0.1 dy=0.01
window width=8 ymin=-1.2 ymax=1.54
layer si 0 0.34
symmetry even
field tm
expect neff 2.795094659 2e-8
expect confinement 0.714919426 1e-6
expect guided no
expect cells 10960
expect neff 2.794445 3e-3
